      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was renamed Williams to honor William Williams, who donated much of the land for the townsite.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.cityofwilliams.org/community/index.php",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Williams sits at the crossroads of Interstate 5 and State Route 20, about 60 miles north of Sacramento.",
